---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Blog
description: Notes on RAG systems, Agentic AI patterns, LLM evaluation, and local model workflows.
permalink: /blog/
---
<section class="listing" aria-labelledby="blog-heading">
  <h1 id="blog-heading">Blog</h1>
  <p class="listing-intro">Notes from the build loop: system design, experiments, and practical patterns for production AI.</p>
  <div class="blog-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <article class="post">
        <div>
          <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
          <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        </div>
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
